    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Party! \ud83e\ude93\ud83e\ude93\ud83e\ude93</h2><br>Axe Party VR is a virtual reality axe-throwing experience. Compete against your friends or your own high score with 3 exciting and challenging game modes. <br>Unlike other titles, our multiplayer is contained in a single VR headset allowing you to show off your axe-throwing skills and compete with your friends locally, without having to purchase multiple devices.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>1. Classic Axe Throw: 5 throws per round. 3 rounds. Highest score wins. <br></li><li>2. BreakRoom: A room of fun gadgets and breakables.<br></li><li>3. Axe Hunt: Hunt virtual birds with axes.</li></ul>",
